    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d710">

                <pb facs="0814" n="729" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg729"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">823.00/276</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The British Embassy to the
                            Department of State</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum</hi></p>
                <p>As regards the new Government in Peru, His Majesty’s Representative has been
                    instructed to act in concert with his French, Italian and United States
                    colleagues or with a majority of them to accord recognition which pending the
                    completion of constitutional formalities should be <hi rendition="#italic">de
                        facto</hi> only. If other Powers accord full recognition, His Majesty’s
                    Government are prepared to consider similar action.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1919-07-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 16, 1919</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
